sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant GW as Kuadrant/Authorino<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant API as API Server<br/>8000/TCP
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant S3 as S3 Storage
    participant RD as Redis/Valkey
    participant Proc as Processor<br/>StatefulSet
    participant LLM as llm-d Gateway

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client,RD: Flow 1: Batch Job Submission
        Client->>GW: POST /v1/files<br/>TLS 1.2+, API key/SA token
        GW->>API: Forward + X-MaaS-Username header
        API->>PG: Store file metadata
        API->>S3: Upload input file (JSONL)
        API-->>GW: 200 OK (file_id)
        GW-->>Client: File upload response

        Client->>GW: POST /v1/batches<br/>TLS 1.2+, API key/SA token
        GW->>API: Forward + X-MaaS-Username header
        API->>PG: Create batch job record
        API->>RD: Enqueue job (priority queue)
        API-->>GW: 200 OK (batch_id)
        GW-->>Client: Batch created response
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Proc,LLM: Flow 2: Batch Processing
        Proc->>RD: Poll for jobs (every 5s)
        RD-->>Proc: Dequeue job
        Proc->>PG: Read job metadata
        Proc->>S3: Download input file
        Note over Proc: Build per-model execution plan<br/>Group by model + system-prompt hash
        loop For each inference request (AIMD controlled)
            Proc->>LLM: POST inference request<br/>TLS 1.2+ (optional mTLS)
            LLM-->>Proc: Inference response
            Note over Proc: Adjust concurrency<br/>(AIMD: +1 on success,<br/>/2 on 429/5xx)
        end
        Proc->>S3: Upload output file
        Proc->>PG: Update job status → completed
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Proc,PG: Flow 3: GC Orphan Reconciliation
        participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP
        participant GCW as GC Reconciler
        GCW->>K8s: Watch processor pods<br/>ServiceAccount token
        K8s-->>GCW: Pod deleted event
        GCW->>PG: Find orphaned in-progress jobs
        GCW->>RD: Re-enqueue or expire orphaned jobs
    end
